use case:

i have people in various departments, HR has a csv file that has username mapped to say department, position and age.
data is provided in csv file with 1st column has a key i.e. username
system should take this file prepare it for use, load in piper (remember we can run multiple pipers ) and when configured in piper, every record in a dataset that has corresponding field User:username that is matched to provided data will get data from enrichment database appended to outgoing dataset.